{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL095ZSUyME1hbXUlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Oye Mamu","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/qdAFtTYcxNocaFf3iBxXeLupL1t.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4gSp8oseHPqNVp4wWj8uXFC3hPo.jpg","description":"Rohit Mamu (Ruslaan Mumtaz) is a man who dreams of being rich one day. These dreams and his investments in them have taken him from being reasonably well off to flat broke. Akhil Bhanja (Tanay Chheda) is a 10-year-old mischievous school boy with a rather crazy streak. There is very little love lost between Mamu (maternal uncle) and Bhanja (nephew) as Rohit has been at the receiving end of many of Akhil's pranks. A crazy turn of events brings the two under one roof for two weeks. Life under Mamu's supervision is now a constant strife for Bhanja. There are a series of clashes between the two as Rohit tries to discipline Akhil but this master-of-manipulation Bhanja more often than not, gets the better of Mamu. Akhil's secret ambition to become a VJ collide with a museum trip, a diamond robbery, the Runaway Bhanja, the police and crooks on Mamu's tail - to converge in an action-packed, rib-tickling climax before the various plots resolve themselves.\n\nReleased 6 Aug 2021 · India · Language: Hindi\nStudio: Fourth Wall Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Comedy","Bollywood"],"imdb_id":"tt14985658","moviedb_id":858383,"tmdbId":858383,"cast":["Ruslaan Mumtaz","Kulraj Randhawa","Tanay Chheda","Gulshan Grover","Asrani","Tiku Talsania"],"director":["Vikram Singh"],"writer":["Vikram Singh"],"released":"2021-08-06T00:00:00.000Z","country":"India","language":"Hindi","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Vikram Singh","character":"Director"},{"name":"Ruslaan Mumtaz","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rFCXCfYgil2VQSg5fMiEpMpBA98.jpg"},{"name":"Kulraj Randhawa","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fB